                                                                  2428 1451
  Updates of energy-angular distributions related to the emitted  2428 1451
  charged particles ( AUG. 2023)                                  2428 1451
                                                                  2428 1451
  H.I. Kim (KAERI),                                               2428 1451
  H.Y. Lee, T. Kawano, S.A. Kuvin, and M.W. Herman (LANL)         2428 1451
                                                                  2428 1451
  Energy-angular distributions of discrete and continuum levels   2428 1451
  and photon transitions related to emitted charged particles     2428 1451
  (proton, deuteron, triton, helium-3 and alpha)                  2428 1451
  have been updated [1] using CoH3 [2] and formatted into         2428 1451
  the ENDF-6 format using DeCE [3]. The Q-values have been        2428 1451
  calculated using the mass data in Audi's 2012 mass table [4]    2428 1451
  and FRDM2012 massess [5].                                       2428 1451
                                                                  2428 1451
  Summary of updated MF/MT                                        2428 1451
  MF=4  MT= 600-639, 800-839 were deleted.                        2428 1451
  MF=12/14  MT= 601-639, 801-839 were deleted.                    2428 1451
  MF=6  MT= 104, 105, 106 were deleted.                           2428 1451
  MF=3  MT= 650-659, 699, 700-709, 749, 750-759, 799 were added.  2428 1451
  MF=6  MT= 600-639, 650-659, 699, 700-709, 749, 750-759, 799,    2428 1451
            800-839 were added.                                   2428 1451
                                                                  2428 1451
***********                                                       2428 1451
References                                                        2428 1451
                                                                  2428 1451
